# Keep text files LF in the repository and in every checkout. `bureau doctor`
# warns about CRLF, so this keeps notes portable between Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Use Git's built-in Markdown diff driver: hunk headers name the nearest
# heading. This also changes the hunk headers `bureau report` prints for this
# repository; remove this line if you prefer Git's default headers.
*.md text diff=markdown
